                                                "sense_id": "a52cd1b3-f0f4-3591-9a36-70f219574792",
                                                "text": "France spent large portions of the opening half in England territory and despite scoring the pick of the first-half tries - when Menager fended off Jess Breach to finish off a superb backs move - struggled to convert their chances."
